/E (The development environment for the EVENTHUB system is designed to support efficient full-stack application development and testing. The project is developed using widely adopted integrated development environments that provide features such as code editing, debugging, and version control support. Frontend development is carried out using standard web technologies, including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, which enable the creation of responsive and interactive user interfaces. Backend development is implemented using Node.js and Express.js to handle server-side logic and API communication. A relational database management system is used to store and manage application data securely. This environment ensures smooth integration between frontend, backend, and database components.)
