/P 278 0 R
/E (To extend EVENTHUB beyond a basic event listing platform, the system can be integrated with external payment gateway services such as Razorpay, Stripe, or similar providers to handle secure online ticket payments. During the booking process, the application layer communicates with the payment gateway through REST APIs, sending details such as user information, event ID, ticket amount, and transaction reference. On successful payment, the gateway returns a confirmation response, which is stored in the EVENTHUB database along with booking details, enabling organizers to track paid bookings and generate basic reports.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
